---
// Demos.astro — before/after Test-Time Training
---
<section id="demos" class="content-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Test-Time Training in Action</h2>
    <p class="section-description">
      The same CALVIN task sequence before and after Test-Time Training. Green marks successfully
      completed sub-tasks, red marks failures. After a few TTT updates to the world model, the agent
      models the environment well enough to finish the full sequence.
    </p>

    <div class="demos-grid">
      <figure class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-tag before">Before TTT</div>
        <img src="figures/before_ttt.gif" alt="Rollout before Test-Time Training: the agent stalls after the first sub-task." loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>The policy halts after the first sub-task and fails the rest of the sequence.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-tag after">After TTT</div>
        <img src="figures/after_ttt.gif" alt="Rollout after Test-Time Training: the agent completes the full task sequence." loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>With an adapted world model, the agent completes the full sequence of sub-tasks.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .demos-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .demo-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .demo-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .demo-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  .demo-tag.before { background: #fee2e2; color: #b91c1c; }
  .demo-tag.after { background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; }
  .demo-card figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .demos-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
